  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Targeted LPZ Food Aid Programme, Binga District</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)	To improve the health and nutritional status of targeted vulnerable groups in Binga District.

2)	To provide additional support to household clients under the HBC programme.

3)	Promote increased participation of communities and vulnerable households in the Livelihoods Programme Zimbabwe and ensure long-term sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
